<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-032" chapter-id="c-nanshi-032-zilong-xu" source-id="s-nanshi-032-zilong-xu-ws1494939">
  <p id="c-nanshi-032-zilong-xu:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-032-zilong-xu:p001:m0000" ref="q4c_ppp_p5h_AAA">文伯</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-032-zilong-xu:p001:m0003" ref="q4c_ppp_p5h_AAA">德秀</persName>，濮陽太守<persName id="c-nanshi-032-zilong-xu:p001:m0010" ref="q4c_ppp_p5h">熙</persName>曾孫也。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-032-zilong-xu:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-032-zilong-xu:p002:m0000" ref="q4c_ppp_p5h">熙</persName>開之，乃扁鵲鏡經一卷，因精心學之，遂名震海內。生子<persName id="c-nanshi-032-zilong-xu:p002:m0026" ref="q4c_ppp_p5h_A">秋夫</persName>，彌工其術，仕至射陽令。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-032-zilong-xu:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-032-zilong-xu:p003:m0000" ref="q4c_ppp_p5h_A">秋夫</persName>生<persName id="c-nanshi-032-zilong-xu:p003:m0003" ref="q4c_ppp_p5h_AA">道度</persName>、<persName id="c-nanshi-032-zilong-xu:p003:m0006" ref="q4c_ppp_p5h_AB">叔向</persName>，皆能精其業。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-032-zilong-xu:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-032-zilong-xu:p004:m0000" ref="q4c_ppp_p5h_AA">道度</persName>生<persName id="c-nanshi-032-zilong-xu:p004:m0003" ref="q4c_ppp_p5h_AAA">文伯</persName>，<persName id="c-nanshi-032-zilong-xu:p004:m0006" ref="q4c_ppp_p5h_AB">叔向</persName>生<persName id="c-nanshi-032-zilong-xu:p004:m0009" ref="q4c_ppp_p5h_ABA">嗣伯</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-032-zilong-xu:p005" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-032-zilong-xu:p005:m0000" ref="q4c_ppp_p5h_ABA">嗣伯</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-032-zilong-xu:p005:m0003" ref="q4c_ppp_p5h_ABA">叔紹</persName>，亦有孝行，善清言，位正員郎</p>
</text>
